edit(j,5,title='Evaluate identity-resolution data before using it for ecommerce outreach',summary='Assess the origin, permitted use and quality of matched visitor data before considering it for a marketing audience.',steps=['Document which data is matched, how it was obtained and what permissions the provider claims.','Have the responsible privacy owner confirm whether the proposed brand, channel and jurisdiction are covered; a provider\'s network opt-in claim alone is insufficient.','Do not send to matched visitors until the actual proposed use is confirmed; preserve suppression and opt-out handling.','If a permitted pilot proceeds, measure incremental outcomes, complaints and delivery quality separately from owned opt-in audiences.'],caveats=['The source\'s acquisition lift is a case claim, not evidence of permission or a forecast.'])
